body:
This test case is named “should export Data namespace”, but it only asserts that defineStack exists (and never type-checks the Data namespace export). Consider either renaming the test to what it actually verifies, or adding a compile-time type assertion (e.g., importing Data as a type / using expectTypeOf) so the test actually covers namespace re-exports.
```suggestion
    expect(types).toHaveProperty('Data');
    expect(types.Data).toBeDefined();
```
